<title>FINLAND: KESKO SAYS BUYS NESTE'S AUTO SUPPLY UNIT.</title>
<headline>KESKO SAYS BUYS NESTE'S AUTO SUPPLY UNIT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish wholesaler and retailer Kesko Oy said on Friday it had acquired Neste Markkinointi Oy's automotive supply unit for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>&quot;The deal will significantly reinforce Kesko's auto parts business,&quot; Kesko said in a statement.</p>
</text>
